-----------------------------------

	   7	    6	    5	    4	   3	  2	  1	 0
	[ RB2 ] [ I2EN ] [ STA ] [ STO ] [ SI ] [ AA ] [ RBI ] [ RB0 ]

	AA    :- Assert Acknowledge First 
	
	SI    :- I2C Interrupt flag 
	
	STO   :- Stop flag 
	
	STA   :- Start flag 

	I2EN  :- I2C Interface Enable 

	RBX   :- Reserved Bit 


